                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "fd875a3e-7044-4a5b-a4c3-eb42488b4ab1",
                        "entry_id": "7b931a9a-29e3-3380-8a84-a11f2c73594d",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "pangrammes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                        "entry_id": "7b931a9a-29e3-3380-8a84-a11f2c73594d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Phrase ayant la caractéristique de contenir toutes les lettres de l’alphabet, même si elle peut parfois être dénuée de sens véritable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "60d9f4c4-0720-4b0b-b926-8928231275cb",
                                "sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                                "text": "« Portez ce vieux whisky au juge blond qui fume. » est un pangramme classique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d37bbf38-acbd-4765-bad1-fcfcff6dad41",
                                "sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                                "text": "« Voix ambiguë d'un cœur qui au zéphyr préfère les jattes de kiwi. » est un pangramme courant."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4b854047-d998-4edd-8652-683380d88a7d",
                                "sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                                "text": "Les pangrammes servent au contrôle qualitatif des polices de caractères."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ad2808a-4119-4fc2-b890-2abc70e623ea",
                                "sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                                "text": "S’agissant d’un jeu plutôt limité, un seul pangramme est notoirement connu : Portez ce vieux whisky au juge blond qui fume."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ab213e7e-d548-4d36-90c4-d11bdd24f109",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b931a9a-29e3-3380-8a84-a11f2c73594d",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Pangram",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30b20641-4269-4b08-b904-d51ebee27e71",
                        "source_entry_id": "7b931a9a-29e3-3380-8a84-a11f2c73594d",
                        "source_sense_id": "f2c3516a-cd87-3e8d-be40-e2fdb3621c0c",
                        "target_lang_word": "pangram",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pangram",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c06c07b-912c-39aa-bd41-fa6cd11628ba",
                                        "entry_id": "c46a61f0-6ae6-3ceb-8f93-2021df0f32d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sentence that contains every letter of the alphabet."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "748afa18-974a-4b7d-ac80-0d8498440313",
                                                "sense_id": "7c06c07b-912c-39aa-bd41-fa6cd11628ba",
                                                "text": "Higher in the scale range the Cadmean curiosities of the Pangram, Lipogram, and Anagram. The first of these must contain the entire alphabet, and claims the twenty-first verse of the seventh chapter of the Prophet Ezra as its most noted example."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5d7e5e1-ea53-437f-9968-3858580f96d7",
                                                "sense_id": "7c06c07b-912c-39aa-bd41-fa6cd11628ba",
                                                "text": "Like the search for the perfect palindrome, the pursuit of the perfect pangram has obsessed many people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e023dd9b-475d-443a-a674-ccfb02e1e206",
                                                "sense_id": "7c06c07b-912c-39aa-bd41-fa6cd11628ba",
                                                "text": "Write a Python function to determine whether or not a string is a pangram."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c41a63e4-db1a-3e6c-b591-2fe99329a69b",
                                        "entry_id": "c46a61f0-6ae6-3ceb-8f93-2021df0f32d8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A crossword puzzle in which every letter appears in the completed grid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dca7184d-52bd-4339-99ea-785a3f170250",
                                                "sense_id": "c41a63e4-db1a-3e6c-b591-2fe99329a69b",
                                                "text": "A pangram (or, as some manage, the triple pangram, with at least three of every letter) restricts the options, directing the setter away from habits and repetition and towards a fresher puzzle."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f78ce884-1595-4c61-806b-10c0623e0a9b",
                                                "sense_id": "c41a63e4-db1a-3e6c-b591-2fe99329a69b",
                                                "text": "I've always wanted to make an anti-pangram pangram puzzle - the NYT would never run something so self-mocking!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8e3247d4-50dc-45c3-af39-67a1e5db20c7",
